ƒgascribeƒgproduct‚dbasefEntityƒgproduct‚fvectorƒgproduct‚dbasefEntityƒgproductƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunitdmark‚fvectorƒhgrounded‚dbasefEntity‚dbasefEntityƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;om_BHtnmk3q-afpTWp9YY24j7qflZNxmF0dSvc3eefoƒdpairƒfvectorƒgproduct‚dbasefEntityƒgproductƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunitdmark˜Nƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;om_BHtnmk3q-afpTWp9YY24j7qflZNxmF0dSvc3eefoƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;uw8uwN_QRhLlJWEgQw85B3rYxQkVclUMRBC21GARcngƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxRni:///sha-256;YQgYjWpapNNSLass4p5xAwYt1m5oHVoyf8epvd1raKU.refused-invalid-evidenceƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;SM80oA7mWQ1fw0oaK5ryk3YfPJjiIfPojXlyTXMHcKEƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;L8QD-Ue5c55Yidn6Gc_jPtdzexTeYsTZouvLf09Zut0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;kzgkiMqQREjZHB2l7DpdTOcUKXlAfG6Lqn41b8rBqwQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;w2urQFi2FzJzF_CfB4-iToPBb1DKC3TdmuGPhAAnzEoƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;QzVHQNQdaaPz9PrlPWS1jXs5BGzgitQe8hGXPNNtkPkƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;UmuDAx3HHPmqYq4CNloj0ZPuSD46isAEt8hDIoRl8Igƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;m08FVdtTSS2RO9nBOOrCGwbaDgYvMGkm3zYBu-_X5AMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxclaude-code-cli-invocationsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;EaglTKYwNyDiyfPTcoPiU9oLyIMf9lBEmGxkubegma4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka1ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;KiRMmrGgFsgJqa4o6KsZlQcld5g7cyAZcs05wH3aShUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarke1.618ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;vnE01_3-soknFeiOxAmRi4pFB1R8EZ7wMyIHGSSLnLcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxexchange-20260719-081403-eb4579ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;KTQRV66QwhqBVgsXsO_WFgQuHpO2gNni6uiTNcUeic8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgrefusalƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;BvG49XCusV2HcleQVbkEM1h4skkhIPzynUSYD4AGPqUƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;RR-f51hsas0PiYvxrOq3h5Gq0KTN2Rfw5qzhm75Lemsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkd6000ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;pmvPAUtytWtu9GBbv3SBb1d0NTyBGRT4SIVyFy66vF4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;-qHqO8MFocUtHR33tckM3fz4FDLHHQnIBoJBByOVuysƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;9Ln1z19fAEVMKpmKX-PYwR4YxvolSXMFswgPf-tzkJgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky´You hold an independent editorial assessment duty. Do not rewrite the manuscript and do 